{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2021-11-22 15:00:00', 'title': 'MIKE RILEY AND DAN THOMAS NAMED CO-HEADS OF MARKETS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MIKE RILEY AND DAN THOMAS HAVE BEEN NAMED CO-HEADS OF THE MARKETS DIVISION OF THE CORPORATE & INVESTMENT BANK (CIB). RILEY AND THOMAS WILL LEAD ALL OF CIB'S MARKETS-DRIVEN ACTIVITIES, INCLUDING: ASSET-BACKED FINANCE, EQUITIES (INCLUDING EQUITY RESEARCH AND STRATEGY), MACRO AND SPREAD. MOST RECENTLY, RILEY HELD THE ROLE OF HEAD OF EQUITIES AND THOMAS SERVED AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF CIB. THEY WILL"}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2021-11-22 14:01:00', 'title': 'STATEMENT FROM WELLS FARGO CEO CHARLIE SCHARF', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO CEO CHARLIE SCHARF TODAY ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT REGARDING PRESIDENT BIDEN'S ANNOUNCEMENT OF HIS INTENT TO RENOMINATE JEROME POWELL AS CHAIR OF THE BOARD OF GOVERNORS OF THE FEDERAL RESERVE SYSTEM (THE FEDERAL RESERVE) AND TO NOMINATE DR. LAEL BRAINARD TO SERVE AS VICE CHAIR OF THE FEDERAL RESERVE: “CONGRATULATIONS TO CHAIRMAN POWELL AND DR. BRAINARD ON THEIR NOMINATIONS AS CHAIR AND VICE CHAIR OF THE FEDERAL RESERVE, RESPECTIVELY. CHAIRMAN POW"}